cartridge "SHOO!/AMY BIENVENU/2026"

' SHOO! - an original tower defence game for the ColecoVision.
'
' Crows walk the farm road to the barn; each one that gets in takes corn.
' Put guards on the stubble beside the road to frighten them away: the
' SCARECROW scares and slows every crow near it, the CLAPPER gives a loud
' clack now and then that carries far, the OWL stares down the crow that
' is closest to the barn. A frightened crow flies off and leaves seeds,
' and seeds buy and improve guards. Three fields of eight waves each.
'
' House rules: joystick and button only; text in columns 2-29, rows 1-22;
' tiles from code 128 (art.py); an original tune played once (tune.py);
' the frame loop keeps the NMI off outside the wait (Frame1).
'
' Screen: row 1 the counters, rows 2-21 the field (14 x 10 cells of 16 x
' 16 pixels), row 22 the menu or the news. Sprite 0 is the frame, 1-12
' the crows.

